   :doc "Bring back the sessions a host boot took down: newest activity first, under the memory budget, each conversation reopened where it ran. [:dry-run true] [:only [<session> …]] [:all true] [:dismiss [<session> …]]"
   :task (apply nido-session/revive *command-line-args*)}

  nido:session:down
