   :doc "Kept session-start failures with their evidence: the ones owed a recovery, or all of them; for a cause, also the recoveries that tried it — runs, and workstreams from before runs. [:cause <key>] [:all true]"
   :task (apply nido-recovery/failures *command-line-args*)}

  nido:recovery:dismiss
